 *
 * Single binary, two roles. DREDD_ROLE picks which entry boots:
 *
 *   DREDD_ROLE=hook       (default) — the hot path: /intent, /evaluate,
 *                                     /track, /end, /pivot, /compact,
 *                                     /register + health + /api/feed +
 *                                     /api/mode. Runs the Bedrock/Ollama
 *                                     preflight.
